      "writtenOn": "2025-04-17T12:22:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good work Kamil, I think that\u0027s what we should aim at with unification of handling of svdm version in pd module.\n\nI\u0027m wondering if there is a possibility to ran more extensive tests with devices supporting SVDM version 2.0, as well as devices supporting only usb PD 2.0 - so SVDM version 1.0 and see if these changes lead to any issues.\n\nOne thing to note is that the change does not incorporate handling of SVDM 2.0 and 1.0 objects - it fills them like version 2.1. It theoretically should not lead to any issues, but I think we should test that before merging this CL.",
      "revId": "170c0246f8131fd54a69c4fc0f5528fb970acf22",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
